1\. REST APIs & HTTP
====================

  

### What is REST?

  

REST is an architectural style for building APIs around **resources**.

  

Example:

  

http

    GET    /users/123POST   /usersPUT    /users/123DELETE /users/123

  

### Important HTTP methods

  

Method

Purpose

GET

Read

POST

Create

PUT

Replace/update

PATCH

Partial update

DELETE

Delete

  

### Important status codes

  

    200 OK201 Created204 No Content400 Bad Request401 Unauthorized403 Forbidden404 Not Found409 Conflict429 Too Many Requests500 Internal Server Error502 Bad Gateway503 Service Unavailable

  

