2\. Authentication vs Authorization
===================================

  

This is one of the most common interview questions.

  

### Authentication

  

>   
> 
> **Who are you?**
> 
>   

  

Example:

  

    Login → email/password → verify → create session/JWT

  

### Authorization

  

>   
> 
> **What are you allowed to do?**
> 
>   

  

Example:

  

    User → can edit own postAdmin → can delete any post

  

Think:

  

    Authentication = IdentityAuthorization  = Permission

  

