10\. Sharding & Replication
===========================

  

These are frequently confused.

  

Replication
-----------

  

Creates copies of data.

  

                 Primary            /       \       Secondary  Secondary

  

Purpose:

  

  
*     
    
    high availability
    
      
    
  
*     
    
    failover
    
      
    
  
*     
    
    read scaling in some systems
    
      
    
  

  

* * *

  

Sharding
--------

  

Splits data across machines.

  

    Shard 1 → users A-FShard 2 → users G-MShard 3 → users N-Z

  

Purpose:

  

>   
> 
> **Horizontal scalability.**
> 
>   

  

MongoDB supports both replication and sharding.

  

