11\. CAP Theorem & Consistency Models
=====================================

  

CAP says that during a **network partition**, a distributed system must choose between:

  

    ConsistencyAvailability

  

while partition tolerance is required for distributed systems.

  

### C

  

Every read gets the latest write.

  

### A

  

Every request receives a response.

  

### P

  

System continues operating despite network partition.

  

### Important interview clarification

  

Don't say:

  

>   
> 
> "You can choose any two of CAP."
> 
>   

  

Better:

  

>   
> 
> When a network partition occurs, a distributed system must trade off consistency versus availability.
> 
>   

  

