18\. Connection Pooling
=======================

  

Opening a database connection for every request is expensive.

  

Bad:

  

    Request ↓Create DB connection ↓Query ↓Close connection

  

Instead:

  

                 Connection Pool           /   /   |   \   \Request → connectionRequest → connectionRequest → connection

  

Node.js MongoDB drivers maintain connection pools.

  

### Interview question

  

**Why connection pooling?**

  

Because creating connections has overhead, and pooling allows connections to be reused efficiently.

  

